{"id":"d303539c48e08599","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-binary-sat-completeness.md","title":"Cook–Levin Theorem","display":"thm-cook-levin — Cook–Levin Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-binary-sat-completeness","aliases":["73-thm-binary-sat-completeness","73-thm-cook-levin"],"display":"thm-cook-levin — Cook–Levin Theorem","depends_on":["[[73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat]]","[[73-df-binary-np-completeness]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.2–10.3, print pp. 434–458; PDF pp. 456–480; local explicit syntax/coding","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§13.2, Theorem 13.1, pp. 324–328; local syntax and binary coding","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-binary-sat-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-binary-sat-completeness</span><span>73-thm-cook-levin</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cook-levin — Cook–Levin Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3eb1d15e0e8f389d\" href=\"?note=3eb1d15e0e8f389d\" title=\"73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat\">73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"41d5b79d11297576\" href=\"?note=41d5b79d11297576\" title=\"73-df-binary-np-completeness\">73-df-binary-np-completeness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.2–10.3, print pp. 434–458; PDF pp. 456–480; local explicit syntax/coding"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§13.2, Theorem 13.1, pp. 324–328; local syntax and binary coding"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoolCoding}\">\\(\\operatorname{BoolCoding}\\)</span> 及编码包类型见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3eb1d15e0e8f389d\" href=\"?note=3eb1d15e0e8f389d\" title=\"73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat\">73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 在第一个断言中量化，不作为预先固定的包。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 在满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span> 的编码包上定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NPC}\">\\(\\mathsf{NPC}\\)</span> (NP-complete binary languages, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"41d5b79d11297576\" href=\"?note=41d5b79d11297576\" title=\"73-df-binary-np-completeness\">73-df-binary-np-completeness</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cook\\text{-}levin}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\mathcal C:\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\;\n\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}\\in\\mathsf{NPC}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cook\\text{-}levin}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\mathcal C:\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\;\n\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}\\in\\mathsf{NPC}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cook\\text{-}levin}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NPC}\\neq\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cook\\text{-}levin}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NPC}\\neq\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A truth assignment restricted to variables occurring in the input is a polynomial-size certificate, so <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}\\in\\mathsf{NP}\">\\(\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}\\in\\mathsf{NP}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>For any nondeterministic polynomial-time machine, the tableau construction produces in polynomial time a formula satisfiable exactly when an accepting computation tableau exists. The fixed prefix coding has linear-time parsing and polynomially related size, so the reduction is genuinely polynomial rather than representation-dependent.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat","status":"resolved","id":"3eb1d15e0e8f389d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-np-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"41d5b79d11297576","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-np-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat","status":"resolved","id":"3eb1d15e0e8f389d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{BoolCoding}$ 及编码包类型见 [[73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat]]；$\\mathcal B$ 在第一个断言中量化，不作为预先固定的包。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-np-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"41d5b79d11297576","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{NPC}$ (NP-complete binary languages, see [[73-df-binary-np-completeness]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{BoolCoding}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NPC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cook\\text{-}levin}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\mathcal C:\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\;\n\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}\\in\\mathsf{NPC}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cook\\text{-}levin}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NPC}\\neq\\varnothing","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}\\in\\mathsf{NP}","display":false}],"bytes":2119,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-271","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-binary-sat-completeness|Cook–Levin Theorem]]"},{"id":"25929fba481aa4a1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b62119f4f9a2bf93","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38822aafbdc2b135","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定满足 $\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)$ 的编码包。$\\mathsf{ThreeSAT}_{\\mathcal B}$ 见 [[73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas]]；$\\mathsf{NPC}$ 见 [[73-df-binary-np-completeness]]，普通 SAT 完备性见 [[73-thm-binary-sat-completeness]]。"}],"outgoing":["3eb1d15e0e8f389d","41d5b79d11297576"]}